Usage: abctl <command> [flags]

Airbyte's command line tool for managing a local Airbyte installation.

Flags:
  -h, --help       Show context-sensitive help.
  -v, --verbose    Enable verbose output.

Commands:
  local credentials [flags]
    Get local Airbyte user credentials.

  local install [flags]
    Install local Airbyte.

  local deployments [flags]
    View local Airbyte deployments.

  local status
    Get local Airbyte status.

  local uninstall [flags]
    Uninstall local Airbyte.

  images manifest [flags]
    Display a manifest of images used by Airbyte and abctl.

  version [flags]
    Display version information.

Run "abctl <command> --help" for more information on a command.
